# agy logged-out probes, ADR-0040 C5 (stage 3 of the agy spike, 2026-11-12)
# Every probe runs in a scratch git repo under a temp dir, with an isolated state root.
# No model call is made by any probe in this file.

## WSL: Linux 6.6.87.2-microsoft-standard-WSL2, agy 1.5.6, ~/.local/bin/agy
## DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS=unix:path=/run/user/1000/bus
## Each probe: HOME=<tmp> setsid timeout -k 5 90 agy ... </dev/null
isolated HOME=/tmp/<tmp>/home

$ HOME=<tmp> agy models
exit=1
